<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Spanish</p>
<p>first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>19 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>16 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>13 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>12 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>11 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Luis Enrique Martinez</p>
<p>(Barcleona), Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid), Juan Eduardo,Esnaider</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid)</p>
<p>10 - Alfonso Perez (Real Betis), Predrag Mijatovic (RealMadrid)</p>
<p>9 - Christopher Ohen (Compostela), Victor Fernandez</p>
<p>Valladolid), Rivaldo (Deportivo Coruna).</p>
